"created_at":"2023-10-25T11:54:54.000Z"},{"id":"AVgxLh9Rq","title":"It's party time! How to watch ADDO with friends and colleagues","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/its-party-time-how-to-watch-addo-with-friends-and-colleagues","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/it-s-party-time-how-to-watch-addo-with-friends-and-colleagues-avgxlh9rq","summary":"Hosting an ADDO viewing party is a unique and engaging way to bring your team together for a day of learning and inspiration. It strengthens team bonds, promotes shared learning, provides inspiration and motivation, and offers networking opportunities. To host a viewing party, you need to select a date and time, choose relevant sessions, set up a comfortable viewing space, provide refreshments, encourage discussions, and follow up with feedback and action items.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4696cb14f3b1886add04ae4c1b6ec33c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-10-25T11:49:51.000Z"},{"id":"OPfKw99rE","title":"Introducing Club 20: The Heartbeat of All Day DevOps","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/introducing-club-20-the-heartbeat-of-all-day-devops","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/introducing-club-20-the-heartbeat-of-all-day-devops-opfkw99re","summary":"Club 20 is a community of organizations committed to DevOps excellence. Members actively engage in discussions, webinars, and special events, and have exclusive networking opportunities. Being a Club 20 member is a recognition of industry leadership and a commitment to continuous improvement in DevOps.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4696cb14f3b1886add04ae4c1b6ec33c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-10-24T14:22:17.000Z"},{"id":"oKlGKCkZm","title":"Spoilers","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/spoilers","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/spoilers-oklgkckzm","summary":"Jamie Coleman talked to just a few of the great speakers coming on All Day DevOps 2023. Spoilers Oct 19, 2023.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4696cb14f3b1886add04ae4c1b6ec33c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-10-19T11:03:17.000Z"},{"id":"Ly2FWBaf0","title":"All Day DevOps 2023 - Code of Conduct","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/all-day-devops-code-of-conduct-0","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/all-day-devops-2023---code-of-conduct-ly2fwbaf0","summary":"All Day DevOps has a code of conduct that promotes a respectful and safe environment for all participants. Harassment of any kind is not tolerated, and violators may be expelled from the organization. No vendor pitches are allowed. If harassment or concerns arise during the conference, participants are encouraged to reach out to Nikki Mejer.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4696cb14f3b1886add04ae4c1b6ec33c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-10-18T15:05:59.000Z"},{"id":"CVW1pQbOp","title":"200 Hours to go","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/200-hours-to-go","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/200-hours-to-go-cvw1pqbop","summary":"All Day DevOps is an upcoming virtual DevOps conference that will feature 24 hours of nonstop education from 180 speakers across 6 tracks. It is the largest virtual DevOps conference in the world.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4696cb14f3b1886add04ae4c1b6ec33c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-10-18T08:23:03.000Z"},{"id":"y73DT222F","title":"Code of Conduct","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/all-day-devops-code-of-conduct","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/code-of-conduct-y73dt222f","summary":"All Day DevOps is dedicated to providing a harassment-free experience for every participant. Harassment includes offensive verbal or written comments related to gender, sexual orientation, disability, physical appearance, body size, race, religion, or any other personal characteristics. Participants will be expelled from the organization at the discretion of the core organizers.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/ea85daa555a9809d8e036407e25bb189","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-09-13T12:40:23.713Z"},{"id":"KULvjIsGj","title":"And that\u2019s a wrap!","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/and-thats-a-wrap","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/and-that-s-a-wrap--kulvjisgj","summary":"All Day DevOps (ADDO) wrapped its sixth straight year of streaming all things DevOps live for 24 hours, from 3 a.m. ET onward, on October 28, 2021. The virtual event gathered nearly 25,000 DevOps professionals for free, hands-on education from 180+ speakers, along with peer-to-peer insights and networking.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a3135236540e2ac37fe0111295b1bb39","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-11-09T13:07:59.706Z"},{"id":"MjJJWoIPc","title":"Modern Secure Infrastructure","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/keynote-modern-secure-infrastructure","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/modern-secure-infrastructure-mjjjwoipc","summary":"Kit Colbert, James Watters, and Ashok Banerjee took part in All Day DevOps (ADDO) The 24-hour event was live-streamed on October 28, 2021, reaching nearly 20,000 DevOps professionals from around the world. The conversations focus on the following two topics: secure software supply chains and DevSecOps.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/df061e26febe231e75b38c0e029f5ebf","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-11-08T13:17:38.733Z"},{"id":"6PC_aFKCA","title":"Keeping the promise of the cloud","url":"https://www.alldaydevops.com/blog/keynote-noelle-silver-keeping-the-promise-of-the-cloud","comments_permalink":"ht